{
  "project": "Proofly",
  "$comment": [
    "The machine-readable form of docs/plan.md. The plan is the narrative; this",
    "is what gets checked. Test ID ranges use 'PREFIX-01..24' and expand to the",
    "individual IDs, which must appear in real test names (docs/test-cases.md).",
    "",
    "Check kinds:",
    "  command            run it in cwd; exit 0 to pass",
    "  test-ids           every listed ID must appear in a test name AND pass",
    "  coverage           lines+branches threshold for files matching a pattern",
    "  files              these paths must exist",
    "  tdd-history        the first commit touching an area must be a test: one",
    "  testcases-status   no listed ID may still be 'Not run' in test-cases.md",
    "API-AUTH-12 moved from day3 to day4 on 28 Oct 2026. It asserts /purchases AND /dashboard return 401 without a cookie; /dashboard is built in day4 slice 4, and Nest runs guards after routing, so a route that does not exist returns 404 and cannot be 401. The test is unchanged - only the phase it holds open."
  ],
  "testCasesFile": "docs/test-cases.md",
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "day1",
      "title": "Requirement lock",
      "status": "passed",
      "slices": [],
      "gate": [
        {
          "kind": "files",
          "label": "Requirements are written down",
          "paths": [
            "docs/requirements.md",
            "docs/plan.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "command",
          "label": "requirements.md is marked LOCKED",
          "cwd": ".",
          "run": "grep -q 'LOCKED' docs/requirements.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "day2",
      "title": "UI/UX design guide and screens",
      "status": "passed",
      "slices": [],
